==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*8 [[Znache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*16 [[Znache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*4 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A common strategy is to utilize units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed M. Titan Cat/Manic Jamiera Cat]], which have the stats to take many hits from Zackie Pengs and Znaches while also being able to kill them very quickly in return. They can also take hits from THE SLOTH, so they can deal damage relatively easily.

Generally speaking though, any units with relatively high damage per hit work here nicely, as they can make quick work on Znaches and keep them from being annoying. It is possible to fight THE SLOTH closer to your base, though as you get closer to your base its more likely Znache will [[Burrow|burrow]] right in front of your base and do a small bit of damage to it, meaning you will need to beware of any burrowing Znaches and take them out so they don't chip your base health down all the way to zero before you kill THE SLOTH.

==Trivia==
*Swamp of Sacrifice's name is derived from ''Devil's Sacrifice'' (悪魔のいけにえ ''Akuma no Ikenie'') and ''Devil's Swamp'' (悪魔の沼 ''Akuma no Numa''), the translated Japanese names of the first two ''[[wikipedia:The Texas Chain Saw Massacre|Texas Chain Saw Massacre]]'' movies.

